  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your senses advance to match those of your animal aspect. You gain one of the following senses available to your beast within: echolocation (imprecise) 30 feet, tremorsense (imprecise) 30 feet, or wavesense (imprecise) 30 feet. If your beast within doesn't typically have a specific type of sense, you can't gain the sense with this feat.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"> </p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Special</strong> You can select this feat multiple times, either choosing a different sense or improving an imprecise sense granted by this feat to a precise sense.</p>"
    },
